WEBVTT

00:00:02.614 --> 00:00:06.744
Not just Minamoto, but even a
high-level esper like the director.

00:00:07.284 --> 00:00:08.974
So, what's she dreaming about?

00:00:12.014 --> 00:00:13.984
It's no use. I can't read anything.

00:00:17.954 --> 00:00:20.684
What are you trying to do?
Let me out at once, or else!

00:00:21.364 --> 00:00:23.034
...you'll be mean to me?

00:00:23.034 --> 00:00:24.434
Why, you!

00:00:24.434 --> 00:00:28.164
The queen belongs to me.
I won't let anyone get in my way.

00:00:29.174 --> 00:00:31.834
Kyosuke... What are you doing?

00:00:33.504 --> 00:00:40.604
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:00:41.614 --> 00:00:47.484
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:49.924 --> 00:00:55.724
Meeting you like I did

00:00:56.064 --> 00:01:00.934
Wasn't just so we could live

00:01:02.204 --> 00:01:07.734
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:01:08.144 --> 00:01:12.734
And surely change the future

00:01:13.344 --> 00:01:16.254
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:01:16.254 --> 00:01:19.374
Is released (changing yourself)

00:01:19.524 --> 00:01:25.254
An angel's shining surges through me

00:01:26.694 --> 00:01:29.264
The "wings" that will save the world

00:01:29.264 --> 00:01:32.094
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:01:32.334 --> 00:01:38.494
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:41.444
The power given to me

00:01:41.444 --> 00:01:44.074
Spurs me into the sky

00:01:44.074 --> 00:01:49.814
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:01:50.154 --> 00:01:55.684
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:02:04.664 --> 00:02:06.724
39th sense: "Impermanent Existence!
Psycho-Divers"

00:02:07.504 --> 00:02:10.904
Leave BABEL and join me, Queen.

00:02:11.534 --> 00:02:12.474
Mr. Hyobu...

00:02:12.904 --> 00:02:17.434
In the dream or in reality, that's the only way out.

00:02:22.514 --> 00:02:25.214
What are you doing here, Kiritsubo?

00:02:25.214 --> 00:02:26.614
You dirty old man!

00:02:27.554 --> 00:02:28.924
Aoi? Shiho?

00:02:28.924 --> 00:02:32.014
Major Hyobu! We can't let our guard
down around you, can we?

00:02:33.464 --> 00:02:36.494
You're holding Minamoto hostage
so you can take Kaoru!

00:02:36.494 --> 00:02:38.294
You unforgivable worm!

00:02:39.304 --> 00:02:41.164
EAT THIS!

00:02:52.114 --> 00:02:54.044
Now you've made me angry.

00:02:55.854 --> 00:02:57.314
What are you doing?!

00:02:57.314 --> 00:02:58.714
Damned terrorist!

00:02:58.714 --> 00:03:02.914
Let go! Stand aside! Limiter, released!

00:03:05.494 --> 00:03:07.964
Queen, we'll talk again some other time.

00:03:08.724 --> 00:03:11.024
Don't insult us! You're not getting away!

00:03:12.504 --> 00:03:15.234
Not bad. As expected of
the Lightspeed Goddess.

00:03:15.664 --> 00:03:17.194
What are you going on about?

00:03:22.004 --> 00:03:23.614
Isn't that overdoing it a little?

00:03:23.614 --> 00:03:25.444
Help us, Kaoru!

00:03:26.114 --> 00:03:28.344
You think he'd die from something like this?!

00:03:28.344 --> 00:03:30.344
Correct, Goddess.

00:03:33.884 --> 00:03:34.654
Aoi!

00:03:35.354 --> 00:03:36.554
Why, you!

00:03:38.424 --> 00:03:40.324
I'll never join you!

00:03:40.324 --> 00:03:42.424
Not if you keep bullying
Minamoto and my friends!

00:03:43.194 --> 00:03:47.064
You won't, will you?
A bad miscalculation on my part.

00:03:47.064 --> 00:03:49.194
I let my impatience get the better of me.

00:03:50.074 --> 00:03:50.794
Wait!

00:03:52.234 --> 00:03:55.144
I'll give you this, as an apology
for my upsetting you.

00:03:56.844 --> 00:03:57.774
A photo?

00:03:57.774 --> 00:04:00.804
You may have the power to enter his dream.

00:04:01.544 --> 00:04:04.074
Grow up quickly, Queen.

00:04:04.754 --> 00:04:06.044
He escaped again.

00:04:06.684 --> 00:04:11.524
I might be able to enter
Minamoto's dream? Meaning what?

00:04:16.734 --> 00:04:17.924
This is!

00:04:19.464 --> 00:04:20.624
Kaoru!

00:04:28.774 --> 00:04:29.864
I'm...

00:04:44.424 --> 00:04:45.324
Kaoru.

00:04:46.894 --> 00:04:49.524
Sorry for the wait, Minamoto.

00:04:49.934 --> 00:04:50.584
No.

00:04:51.794 --> 00:04:54.234
What's wrong? Don't you feel well?

00:04:56.074 --> 00:04:57.834
You might be catching a cold.

00:05:00.944 --> 00:05:02.744
Let's hurry home and get you warmed up.

00:05:02.744 --> 00:05:04.304
Yeah, sure.

00:05:10.284 --> 00:05:11.914
Hey! Use your hands!

00:05:13.184 --> 00:05:15.844
No way! My hands are full right now.

00:05:16.454 --> 00:05:20.554
You're too spoiled, Kaoru.
You aren't a little kid anymore.

00:05:24.534 --> 00:05:25.964
What's going on here?

00:05:26.234 --> 00:05:29.004
You're too spoiled, Kaoru.
You aren't a little kid anymore.

00:05:29.004 --> 00:05:31.734
What are you talking about?!
What's wrong with you?!

00:05:31.904 --> 00:05:34.574
Don't go! I know everything!

00:05:34.574 --> 00:05:37.544
The battle's about to start, right?
You don't have to do this!

00:05:39.484 --> 00:05:43.004
Because if you're determined to go, I'll have to!

00:05:48.484 --> 00:05:49.394
Where?

00:05:49.394 --> 00:05:50.354
Don't move!

00:05:53.894 --> 00:05:57.264
Don't move, Queen Of Catastrophe!

00:05:57.434 --> 00:05:59.124
No... Kaoru!

00:05:59.194 --> 00:06:03.634
Wh-What is this?
Why is Minamoto aiming at me?

00:06:09.204 --> 00:06:12.644
Minamoto, even if I'm gone,
nothing will change.

00:06:12.644 --> 00:06:15.644
An army of other espers will never stop fighting.

00:06:15.644 --> 00:06:17.344
Then stop them!

00:06:17.684 --> 00:06:22.584
Please! Espers! Normals! What does
either side gain from this war?!

00:06:23.454 --> 00:06:24.354
Kaoru!

00:06:24.354 --> 00:06:25.484
It's no use.

00:06:26.494 --> 00:06:28.754
Did you know, Minamoto? I...

00:06:29.434 --> 00:06:30.064
Kaoru!

00:06:30.064 --> 00:06:31.224
Can you hear me, Kaoru?

00:06:31.534 --> 00:06:32.264
Aoi?

00:06:32.264 --> 00:06:34.034
Don't get caught up in the program!

00:06:34.034 --> 00:06:35.964
It's a dream! Understand?!

00:06:35.964 --> 00:06:37.994
What are you saying?

00:06:41.104 --> 00:06:42.004
A dream?

00:06:43.344 --> 00:06:44.514
I've got a reaction!

00:06:44.514 --> 00:06:46.114
Just as I thought.

00:06:46.114 --> 00:06:48.704
The hypnosis is less effective on Kaoru.

00:06:49.114 --> 00:06:51.684
If she can synchronize with Minamoto's mind...

00:06:51.684 --> 00:06:54.174
Right! We may be able to pull
them both out of the dream!

00:06:55.024 --> 00:06:58.324
Find an exit, no matter what!
Can you do that, Kaoru?

00:06:58.324 --> 00:07:00.224
You're shouting! Lower the volume!

00:07:00.824 --> 00:07:02.664
But where would I find an exit?

00:07:02.664 --> 00:07:04.424
We'll work on that from this end!

00:07:05.594 --> 00:07:08.694
Don't resist! Walk towards me slowly, Kaoru!

00:07:09.164 --> 00:07:12.004
Minamoto... You're totally
caught up in the dream.

00:07:12.004 --> 00:07:16.034
Well then, I'll just have to wake you up from it!

00:07:17.414 --> 00:07:20.314
Here we go!

00:07:22.284 --> 00:07:23.474
Kaoru, don't!

00:07:26.754 --> 00:07:29.684
Let's run for it, Minamoto!
This bad dream's over!

00:07:31.054 --> 00:07:32.614
Of course! This is...

00:07:39.434 --> 00:07:41.264
Okay, we can get out through there!

00:07:41.264 --> 00:07:43.434
Wait! That may not be a way out!

00:07:43.434 --> 00:07:46.804
If we break out of the dream program,
we might fall into an even deeper coma!

00:07:47.374 --> 00:07:49.964
We don't have much of a choice here!

00:07:55.284 --> 00:07:55.414
SYNCHRONIZED SWIMMING

00:07:55.414 --> 00:07:57.454
SYNCHRONIZED SWIMMING
Synchronized swimming?

00:07:57.454 --> 00:07:58.584
SYNCHRONIZED SWIMMING
Wrong. If you must, it's synchronized "suimin".

00:07:58.584 --> 00:08:01.084
SYNCHRONIZED SLEEPING
Wrong. If you must, it's synchronized "suimin".

00:08:02.084 --> 00:08:03.954
Aoi, Shiho, prepare to deploy.

00:08:14.064 --> 00:08:14.894
Doubt!

00:08:15.664 --> 00:08:17.934
Why? How do you know?!

00:08:18.634 --> 00:08:20.244
You really suck at this.

00:08:20.244 --> 00:08:21.274
What did you say?!

00:08:21.274 --> 00:08:24.104
Hello, Mr. President. How are you feeling?

00:08:24.374 --> 00:08:26.344
You! The people who attacked me!

00:08:27.084 --> 00:08:29.244
Oh, what strong back muscles you have!

00:08:29.244 --> 00:08:30.114
He must work out.

00:08:31.484 --> 00:08:37.324
I had a look at your personal data file.
A lot of dirty data in there, huh?

00:08:37.324 --> 00:08:38.424
Give it back!

00:08:38.424 --> 00:08:40.324
If you don't want these secrets getting out...

00:08:40.324 --> 00:08:44.364
I know. How about you give me a list

00:08:44.364 --> 00:08:46.994
of the high-level espers your
nation is secretly holding?

00:08:48.234 --> 00:08:49.724
That's absurd! I refuse!

00:08:50.434 --> 00:08:52.234
Don't get me wrong.

00:08:52.234 --> 00:08:54.704
This isn't a negotiation. It's an order.

00:08:59.214 --> 00:09:02.374
So, that was our first big world debut, huh?

00:09:03.084 --> 00:09:05.854
But why did we do it out of
the blue like this, Major?

00:09:05.854 --> 00:09:07.084
No reason.

00:09:07.084 --> 00:09:09.554
You don't want to be stuck causing
trouble in just Japan, do you?

00:09:10.624 --> 00:09:15.664
Besides, the time is coming when
she will reign as the queen.

00:09:15.664 --> 00:09:18.064
Now's the time for me to do what I can.

00:09:18.334 --> 00:09:19.534
I see.

00:09:19.534 --> 00:09:20.894
A fascinating story.

00:09:21.634 --> 00:09:24.194
The power that broke Barrett's brainwashing...

00:09:24.604 --> 00:09:28.374
It certainly stands apart from
ordinary high-level espers.

00:09:28.644 --> 00:09:29.874
Who are?!

00:09:30.444 --> 00:09:32.774
Black Phantom, I presume?

00:09:37.884 --> 00:09:41.184
The one thing I don't know yet is
the meaning of the term "queen",

00:09:41.624 --> 00:09:44.144
but I will report my findings to my master.

00:09:44.754 --> 00:09:47.454
I bid you good day, my PANDRA friends.

00:09:50.394 --> 00:09:52.094
Who was she?!

00:09:55.564 --> 00:09:57.694
You're sure this is the place, The Hound?

00:09:58.234 --> 00:10:00.674
Yeah. I think Kuromaki's alone inside.

00:10:01.074 --> 00:10:02.874
Good girl, Hatsune!

00:10:02.874 --> 00:10:04.274
And here's your reward.

00:10:04.974 --> 00:10:06.004
Hatsune's right.

00:10:06.614 --> 00:10:09.084
I don't see anyone from PANDRA in the area.

00:10:09.554 --> 00:10:12.084
Even so, she's living in a nice place, huh??

00:10:12.084 --> 00:10:14.784
She must be rolling in cash. Meaning...

00:10:14.784 --> 00:10:18.454
People in PANDRA get paid
better than we do, right?

00:10:18.454 --> 00:10:19.194
Hmm...

00:10:19.194 --> 00:10:21.784
Um, maybe this isn't the place
to be thinking about that.

00:10:23.034 --> 00:10:25.824
Great. They would come when the
major and the others are out.

00:10:27.564 --> 00:10:31.164
Whatever. Time to turn the tables on them.

00:10:34.304 --> 00:10:36.574
Y-Yuichi Nakamura.

00:10:40.414 --> 00:10:41.884
Hold it, Geek!

00:10:44.054 --> 00:10:47.614
All right, give the capture
of Kuromaki top priority.

00:10:47.854 --> 00:10:50.224
It's okay. You all can do this.

00:10:50.494 --> 00:10:51.994
Now then, The Children...

00:10:51.994 --> 00:10:53.684
And Wild Cat!

00:10:55.394 --> 00:10:56.294
Released!

00:10:56.294 --> 00:10:56.794
<<RELEASED>> <<RELEASED>>
Released!

00:10:58.794 --> 00:11:00.534
Whether through fire or water...

00:11:00.534 --> 00:11:02.734
We can't go into a dream, but...

00:11:02.734 --> 00:11:05.004
For the sake of our friends, we're going in here!

00:11:05.004 --> 00:11:07.974
The Absolutely Lovely Children and Wild Cat!

00:11:10.174 --> 00:11:12.244
With me, Men!

00:11:12.244 --> 00:11:13.734
Oh, wait.

00:11:14.914 --> 00:11:18.744
There's lots of land mines over there.
Before you go in, Aoi should...

00:11:18.814 --> 00:11:20.824
And it's too late now, isn't it?

00:11:20.824 --> 00:11:22.014
Yes!

00:11:22.124 --> 00:11:25.954
Just stay there! We'll get Kuromaki right now!

00:11:29.594 --> 00:11:31.424
Pretty messy, huh?

00:11:34.364 --> 00:11:35.564
I've got her!

00:11:35.934 --> 00:11:40.434
PSYCHIC STUN SUBJECTION!

00:11:43.144 --> 00:11:43.914
A mirror?

00:11:43.914 --> 00:11:45.004
Bingo!

00:11:47.144 --> 00:11:49.854
That's one on a trip to nightmare land!

00:11:49.854 --> 00:11:50.684
Naomi!

00:11:50.684 --> 00:11:51.584
Hold it!

00:11:57.624 --> 00:11:59.284
What's with this room?

00:12:07.004 --> 00:12:09.494
And that's two more I send on their way.

00:12:13.904 --> 00:12:15.604
Aoi? Shiho?

00:12:17.574 --> 00:12:20.314
Okay, let's make sense of what's going on.

00:12:20.314 --> 00:12:23.874
We're having the same dream due
to Setsuko Kuromaki's power.

00:12:24.584 --> 00:12:27.074
The impetus was psychic photographs.

00:12:27.154 --> 00:12:31.794
Only we two would know what that
particular image of a woman was.

00:12:31.794 --> 00:12:33.594
Hence, we have the same dream.

00:12:33.594 --> 00:12:34.424
Minamoto?

00:12:35.564 --> 00:12:37.034
What I saw before...

00:12:37.034 --> 00:12:39.554
Is that what's actually going
to happen in the future?

00:12:40.864 --> 00:12:41.794
Kaoru...

00:12:42.164 --> 00:12:47.034
I was assuming it was all just a dream, but now...

00:12:47.874 --> 00:12:51.204
My heart was beating so hard...
I was scared to death!

00:12:51.674 --> 00:12:53.944
Do you know something, Minamoto? Tell me!

00:12:57.084 --> 00:12:59.514
Calm down. This is just a dream.

00:12:59.514 --> 00:13:01.074
Don't let Hyobu play you.

00:13:03.324 --> 00:13:04.254
But...

00:13:04.254 --> 00:13:08.824
Besides, I believe in you.
Aren't you girls The Children?

00:13:08.824 --> 00:13:10.384
That's why you never lose!

00:13:13.134 --> 00:13:13.724
You!

00:13:14.164 --> 00:13:17.224
Mental attacks are less effective
on high-level espers.

00:13:17.704 --> 00:13:20.174
Especially since I'm a telepath, like you!

00:13:21.504 --> 00:13:24.204
Then I'll do it again and put you
in the deepest sleep possible!

00:13:26.614 --> 00:13:30.444
No, don't look at it!
She'll catch you in her sleep image!

00:13:35.784 --> 00:13:37.654
How does a little kid get a gun?!

00:13:37.654 --> 00:13:38.994
It's made for kids.

00:13:38.994 --> 00:13:40.464
Liar!

00:13:40.464 --> 00:13:42.624
And you can't shoot with your eyes closed!

00:13:42.624 --> 00:13:44.634
I'm a psychometrist.

00:13:44.634 --> 00:13:46.994
I know where the bullet will hit without looking!

00:13:47.834 --> 00:13:48.634
In that case!

00:13:48.634 --> 00:13:49.264
Stop!

00:13:54.944 --> 00:13:55.964
What's?

00:13:57.514 --> 00:14:00.574
A self-destruct device! I can't disarm it.

00:14:02.514 --> 00:14:04.354
Aoi, wake up!

00:14:04.354 --> 00:14:05.754
Can't...

00:14:08.424 --> 00:14:10.784
This is your weak spot, right?

00:14:12.654 --> 00:14:15.954
DON'T! Not the ears!

00:14:17.234 --> 00:14:18.324
Kojika! Down!

00:14:23.374 --> 00:14:25.204
So long, Chief!

00:14:25.204 --> 00:14:26.134
Kuromaki!

00:14:26.134 --> 00:14:28.434
Too bad, dumb asses!

00:14:35.344 --> 00:14:39.184
You can move now! I cleared all the mines!

00:14:39.184 --> 00:14:39.614
Aoi!

00:14:39.614 --> 00:14:40.744
Naomi!
Aoi!

00:14:44.054 --> 00:14:48.724
How to save Minamoto and the others...
Everything about PANDRA...

00:14:48.724 --> 00:14:50.214
You're going to tell me everything.

00:14:51.294 --> 00:14:54.534
Forget it. You won't get anything from me.

00:14:54.534 --> 00:14:55.394
Because...

00:14:56.434 --> 00:14:58.434
She used her power on herself!

00:14:58.434 --> 00:15:01.404
Stomach's full... Can't eat any more...

00:15:02.904 --> 00:15:04.904
She's shut herself behind a protection wall.

00:15:05.474 --> 00:15:09.504
I can't get any info from her
until she wakes herself up.

00:15:10.854 --> 00:15:12.784
Maybe if you blow in her ear?

00:15:12.854 --> 00:15:14.914
You're the only one who's sensitive to that, Aoi.

00:15:16.454 --> 00:15:18.924
I wonder how long it's been on the outside.

00:15:18.924 --> 00:15:20.794
We need to find a way out of here on our own.

00:15:21.094 --> 00:15:25.494
I don't mind. I was just thinking
I wouldn't mind staying here, like this.

00:15:25.494 --> 00:15:26.604
Hold it!

00:15:26.604 --> 00:15:29.034
Maybe that's why we can't get out of here.

00:15:29.334 --> 00:15:32.404
Your mental waves are stronger
than mine or Kuromaki's.

00:15:32.404 --> 00:15:36.064
Am I an adult now? A child?

00:15:36.644 --> 00:15:40.204
I know I'm just a 10-year-old kid
in the real world, but...

00:15:40.614 --> 00:15:42.174
I just can't think that way.

00:15:43.414 --> 00:15:45.954
I'm having the dirtiest thoughts right now,

00:15:45.954 --> 00:15:48.854
but I want to keep them deep inside my heart.

00:15:48.854 --> 00:15:50.654
It's strange, being an adult...

00:15:51.054 --> 00:15:53.824
Is this what she's always thinking about?

00:15:55.194 --> 00:15:58.664
You're probably being affected
by the dream program.

00:15:58.664 --> 00:16:00.494
You'll go back to normal when you wake up,

00:16:00.564 --> 00:16:04.534
and you'll probably forget everything
you're thinking and feeling now.

00:16:04.534 --> 00:16:06.594
I don't want to. I don't want to forget.

00:16:07.704 --> 00:16:11.444
This is no time to be acting
like a big baby! Wake up!

00:16:11.444 --> 00:16:12.644
No!

00:16:12.644 --> 00:16:18.714
Because I love you ten times as much
now as when I was 10 years old!

00:16:19.884 --> 00:16:21.284
That's right. The moment she speaks...

00:16:21.624 --> 00:16:24.244
Do you know, Minamoto? I...

00:16:24.554 --> 00:16:26.114
Kaoru, don't!

00:16:26.794 --> 00:16:29.954
...always loved you. I love you.

00:16:32.694 --> 00:16:36.434
I heard. I always heard them.

00:16:36.604 --> 00:16:38.094
Those words...

00:16:40.574 --> 00:16:42.764
So why didn't I realize it till now?!

00:16:43.344 --> 00:16:45.474
It may just be a dream, but...

00:16:45.474 --> 00:16:51.144
But to me right now, you're the man
who's protected me for ten years!

00:16:52.454 --> 00:16:57.514
Do you hate me now?
Can you only love me as little Kaoru?

00:16:58.424 --> 00:16:59.754
Kaoru...

00:17:01.624 --> 00:17:07.364
It's okay. Even in the real world,
I'll stay by your side till you're grown.

00:17:07.434 --> 00:17:08.264
I promise.

00:17:09.134 --> 00:17:11.694
Then, does that mean that you?

00:17:16.104 --> 00:17:19.344
I'll answer that when I meet the real you.

00:17:20.014 --> 00:17:23.104
Really? Then promise me!

00:17:34.224 --> 00:17:35.814
That's good enough for now.

00:17:36.194 --> 00:17:37.924
It's a promise, Minamoto.

00:17:42.064 --> 00:17:42.864
Kaoru!

00:17:48.674 --> 00:17:51.434
You may be a little kid,
but you drive a hard bargain.

00:17:52.114 --> 00:17:54.134
Still, it doesn't matter.

00:17:54.644 --> 00:17:56.084
Thank you, Kaoru.

00:17:56.084 --> 00:17:57.644
Oh, you're awake now!

00:17:58.884 --> 00:18:00.854
What the?! You guys?

00:18:01.384 --> 00:18:03.994
Look at her. Kaoru's still asleep.

00:18:03.994 --> 00:18:07.124
Except Kuromaki's power should be wearing off.

00:18:07.124 --> 00:18:08.214
She'll wake up any minute now.

00:18:11.994 --> 00:18:13.964
Huh? Where am I?

00:18:15.164 --> 00:18:15.754
Kaoru!

00:18:17.634 --> 00:18:22.134
Minamoto! You're awake?!
Um, why was I asleep, too?

00:18:22.204 --> 00:18:23.304
Oh, Kaoru.

00:18:23.304 --> 00:18:24.834
Don't you remember anything?

00:18:25.374 --> 00:18:26.614
That's right.

00:18:26.614 --> 00:18:31.244
If espers and Normals can just
live together as human beings,

00:18:31.884 --> 00:18:34.354
then our future will surely be...

00:18:38.154 --> 00:18:40.684
You're naive, kid.

00:18:46.094 --> 00:18:49.124
Perhaps he really has finally realized it.

00:18:49.664 --> 00:18:53.764
Even attaching himself to those girls
may not be enough to save him.

00:19:04.114 --> 00:19:06.824
Hey! Don't fall asleep there!

00:19:06.824 --> 00:19:08.184
'kay...

00:19:09.824 --> 00:19:13.654
I barely got any sleep...
Forget it. I'm at my limit...

00:19:13.894 --> 00:19:15.164
Where's Kaoru?

00:19:15.164 --> 00:19:19.494
She's feeling fine, so she and our
friends went someplace after school.

00:19:19.494 --> 00:19:20.464
I see.

00:19:24.534 --> 00:19:27.934
You all worked hard on this. Thank you.

00:19:30.544 --> 00:19:33.074
A super-rare card, just like I heard they had!

00:19:33.074 --> 00:19:34.814
Good for you, Tono.

00:19:34.814 --> 00:19:38.544
Tono, you should buy Chisato
a present once in a while.

00:19:39.914 --> 00:19:42.184
Well, th-then... Here! Have this Heike Crab card!

00:19:42.254 --> 00:19:43.724
Huh? I don't want that.

00:19:44.254 --> 00:19:45.554
Mr. Hyobu?

00:19:45.694 --> 00:19:46.654
Who's he?

00:19:46.654 --> 00:19:50.184
Oh... Someone I know.
Sorry, can you go on ahead?

00:19:55.134 --> 00:19:57.664
If he tries anything, ring the security buzzer!

00:19:58.674 --> 00:20:00.404
I'll be fine.

00:20:00.474 --> 00:20:03.074
See you tomorrow, Chisato!

00:20:03.074 --> 00:20:06.114
Your classmate's a telepath, Queen?

00:20:06.114 --> 00:20:09.174
Now, look... Can you stop calling me "queen"?

00:20:10.614 --> 00:20:13.054
Only if you stop calling me "Mr. Hyobu".

00:20:14.684 --> 00:20:18.284
Then what should I call you?
Please tell me it's not "Major".

00:20:19.194 --> 00:20:24.294
Kyosuke Hyobu. Yeah... Just call me Kyosuke.

00:20:24.294 --> 00:20:27.924
Darn it, that's not fair.
I can't stay mad at you now.

00:20:29.534 --> 00:20:32.034
I was kidding. Just keep calling
me Mr. Hyobu, like...

00:20:32.034 --> 00:20:34.244
Okay then, Kyosuke...

00:20:34.244 --> 00:20:37.074
Thank you for saving Minamoto.

00:20:38.714 --> 00:20:40.384
Save your thanks.

00:20:40.384 --> 00:20:42.514
The one who actually saved him was you.

00:20:42.514 --> 00:20:45.984
I gave you that hint because
I was no match for your tears.

00:20:45.984 --> 00:20:48.884
I don't remember anything about the dream.

00:20:48.884 --> 00:20:50.824
What was it? What did I?

00:20:50.824 --> 00:20:51.794
Kaoru!

00:20:52.124 --> 00:20:53.924
Don't listen to anything he says!

00:20:54.464 --> 00:20:55.654
Minamoto!

00:20:55.994 --> 00:20:58.524
Ah, you're looking well, Minamoto.

00:21:00.234 --> 00:21:01.804
Stop it, both of you!

00:21:01.804 --> 00:21:05.604
I honestly thought you would have
given up a long time ago.

00:21:06.004 --> 00:21:09.834
I never figured you could make it through
ten cycles of that prediction program.

00:21:10.274 --> 00:21:12.304
Shut up! On the ground, arms apart! Now!

00:21:12.374 --> 00:21:14.214
Don't flatter yourself.

00:21:14.214 --> 00:21:16.304
In the end, I'll be the one
who changes the future.

00:21:18.554 --> 00:21:22.354
Same goes for you!
I swear that I'll protect Kaoru!

00:21:26.794 --> 00:21:31.324
And in deference to your tenacity, I leave
the queen in your hands for now.

00:21:31.764 --> 00:21:33.354
We'll meet again.

00:21:34.064 --> 00:21:34.824
Stop!

00:21:37.134 --> 00:21:37.734
You disgusting, lecherous lolicon.

00:21:37.734 --> 00:21:39.834
You disgusting, lecherous lolicon.
You disgusting, lecherous lolicon.

00:21:40.604 --> 00:21:42.664
Minamoto, what's this?

00:21:43.574 --> 00:21:46.014
What kind of dream were you having?

00:21:49.814 --> 00:21:50.514
Shut up!

00:21:50.784 --> 00:21:54.184
What? Was it the sort of dream
you can't tell anyone about?

00:21:54.184 --> 00:21:56.284
Don't tease grownups!

00:22:01.464 --> 00:22:02.894
Five more years...

00:22:03.694 --> 00:22:07.154
Right... She's really going to make
me wait five years, isn't she?

00:22:21.384 --> 00:22:23.484
When your tears overflow

00:22:23.484 --> 00:22:26.114
I want to gently wipe them away

00:22:26.114 --> 00:22:29.084
Your tiny back which bears a similar

00:22:29.084 --> 00:22:31.454
Destiny

00:22:31.454 --> 00:22:35.624
Even if a tough reality surrounds you

00:22:35.624 --> 00:22:41.534
I won't let you be alone

00:22:41.804 --> 00:22:46.834
Flower that blooms in this filthy city

00:22:46.834 --> 00:22:50.344
While not knowing what filth is

00:22:50.344 --> 00:22:53.474
I absolutely won't let you cry

00:22:53.474 --> 00:22:55.644
As long as I am here

00:22:55.644 --> 00:23:00.824
When that door opens, we can be one

00:23:00.824 --> 00:23:05.154
Only the promise we made that time

00:23:05.154 --> 00:23:10.794
Will always shine deep in my heart

00:23:10.794 --> 00:23:15.504
I won't hurt your heart anymore

00:23:15.504 --> 00:23:18.074
I'm not just saying it

00:23:18.074 --> 00:23:21.874
When I take up your sins

00:23:21.874 --> 00:23:24.804
Together, me and you

00:23:25.044 --> 00:23:30.674
Will make a miracle, Break Your Destiny

00:23:40.994 --> 00:23:41.024
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.024 --> 00:23:41.964
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.964 --> 00:23:42.894
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.164 --> 00:23:46.794
Director Tsubomi has invited us to
her retreat in the snowy mountains!

00:23:46.994 --> 00:23:49.204
And it's there we cause a real stir!

00:23:49.204 --> 00:23:52.074
We have some special guests, too!
Why don't you introduce yourselves?

00:23:52.074 --> 00:23:53.604
Hi! Ayami here!

00:23:53.604 --> 00:23:54.544
Yuika here!

00:23:54.544 --> 00:23:55.474
Suzuka here!

00:23:55.474 --> 00:23:56.844
We're the Karen Girls!

00:23:56.844 --> 00:23:58.044
In the next episode...

00:23:58.044 --> 00:23:59.674
the Karen Girls...

00:23:59.674 --> 00:24:01.444
make our anime debut!

00:24:01.444 --> 00:24:02.744
You absolutely have to see it!

00:24:02.744 --> 00:24:04.084
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:04.084 --> 00:24:06.754
Episode 40: "Tsubomi Mountain
Retreat! Break In!"

00:24:06.754 --> 00:24:07.014
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:07.014 --> 00:24:08.954
Tsubomi Mountain Retreat!
Break In!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

